direction: right

n_OperatorDef: compile-time op trait. lower is the compile to runtime bridge
n_Component: runtime op trait. render render_batch dispatch tiers
n_Node: op output algebra. Emit Many Park Done
n_RenderCtx: dispatch context. pipe hash depth generation bus diagnostics
n_Cursor: payload. focal term plus named terms
n_FactRuntimeGraph: reactive state graph. subscribe support dirty sweep
n_RuntimeGraph: v4 facade over FactRuntimeGraph
n_owner_uri: owner identity key. fiber or switchMap key
n_Subscribe: source in-edge. owner consumes source
n_support: owner keyed-children keep-alive set. DAG reconcile by key

n_OperatorDef -> n_Component: lower bridges compile to runtime
n_Component -> n_Node: render / dispatch return value
n_Component -> n_RenderCtx: dispatch reads ctx
n_Cursor -> n_Component: batch input
n_RuntimeGraph -> n_FactRuntimeGraph: delegates all state
n_Subscribe -> n_FactRuntimeGraph: inserts the subscribe edge
n_owner_uri -> n_RuntimeGraph: keys owner instances
n_support -> n_FactRuntimeGraph: refcount keep-alive set
n_FactRuntimeGraph -> n_Node: dirty sweep re-runs owners

